WEBVTT

00:00:00.469 --> 00:00:05.165
Welcome to Alaventra. Rank in
search. Get recommended by AI.

00:00:06.143 --> 00:00:10.143
In tutorial 1.3, you'll add
the website you want to grow,

00:00:10.193 --> 00:00:12.140
and say where its customers search.

00:00:13.191 --> 00:00:17.801
First, type your website address, or check
the one filled in from the step before.

00:00:20.195 --> 00:00:23.400
Next, choose the main country
your customers search from.

00:00:23.450 --> 00:00:27.392
Rankings, keyword searches and
AI answers are checked there.

00:00:28.356 --> 00:00:31.631
Then, if you like, say what
you do in a sentence or two.

00:00:31.681 --> 00:00:33.675
You'll add the rest in the business step.

00:00:36.381 --> 00:00:39.941
Now click Add website. Next,
you confirm that you own it,

00:00:39.991 --> 00:00:41.785
and series two shows you how.

00:00:43.331 --> 00:00:48.411
Pick one way: Verify with Google,
Add a DNS record, or Add a meta tag.

00:00:48.461 --> 00:00:51.117
Or click Skip for now, and verify later.

00:00:52.112 --> 00:00:56.122
So, type your website address, choose
the main country, say what you do,

00:00:56.172 --> 00:00:57.434
and add the website.

00:00:59.091 --> 00:01:04.239
Your website is added. Next, describe
your business in tutorial 1.4.
